1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,263
Amphicribral.

2
00:00:01,263 --> 00:00:04,700
Cribrum means sieve: the sieve tubes are outside.

3
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:10,325
Amphivasal is the exact reverse, xylem outside, and that is the trap.

4
00:00:10,325 --> 00:00:14,687
Bicollateral has phloem on two sides only, not all round.

